====Canceled debate====
A third debate was scheduled to occur on May 13, hosted by the [[League of Women Voters]], with five candidates invited. Bass withdrew from the debate a week before, after originally committing to attending. Pratt was also invited to the debate, but declined due to a scheduling conflict. On May 11, Raman withdrew from the debate, leading to its cancellation later that day.<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.latimes.com/california/story/2026-05-11/la-mayoral-forum-canceled-after-leading-candidates-pull-out|title=L.A. mayoral forum canceled after leading candidates pull out|work=Los Angeles Times|date=11 May 2026}}</ref>

